and not getting enough  physical sleep are all considered  stressors on the body and stressors  throw up hormones like cortisol which  have an overall catabolic effect not to  mention being tired obviously affects  workout performance so it's really not  surprising that  sleep can compromise your gains so i  absolutely agree that focusing on sleep  will be imperative to her goals both in  the gym and for normalizing her hormones  in preparation to conceive so with all  that said do i think cassie's 90 day  journey to gain muscle is a realistic  goal well i didn't see a specific  numerical goal so i'm not really sure  what she's expecting to see in 90 days  but i don't think i would expect to see  significant muscle growth in this short  period of time i don't think this is  enough calories i don't think it's  enough carbs or fats for hormonal  regulation and i don't think it's enough  rest period if we were a total trading  newbie jumping into a protocol like this  sure we would probably see significant  progress but cassie is already well  conditioned very lean and her protocol  hasn't left much of a buffer for growth  so i would suggest either adjusting  expectations or going back to the  drawing board with the plan and there's  no shame in either outcome i remind you  this is a journey and while i think  putting an arbitrary timeline on these  things does tend to set us up for  disappointment the process is often just  as important as the end result and i  hope that she does get to learn a lot  about this process that she's willing to  share so on that note that's all that i  have for you guys today if you like this  video be sure to give it the thumbs up  leave me a comment below on what or who  you'd like to see me review next  subscribe to the channel and i'll see  you next time on abby's kitchen bye  [Music]
 

